{"script":"s_3_7_0","des":"贫民街的蛇影 接取步骤","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]你们好，我是大市集的拉比尔，是埃迪蒂小姐秘书团队的成员。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]我从埃迪蒂小姐那边了解到，你们是非常厉害的契约者，我有一件事情想要委托你们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来是埃迪蒂的人呀。没关系，直接说就好了，只要是能帮上忙的事情，我们一定会出手的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]非常感谢，接下来我要去贫民街那边完成埃迪蒂小姐安排给我的任务，我希望能请到两位协助我。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"埃迪蒂的任务？","tag":"tag_7"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[cm][show]嗯，埃迪蒂小姐自从暂管大市集之后，就一直想要解决贫民街的麻烦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]因为我原先也是贫民街出身的住民，所以埃迪蒂小姐把任务交给了我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来如此。既然是埃迪蒂的任务，我们愿意帮忙。不过具体要是解决什么问题呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]所有的问题。我们的终极目标，就是要改善贫民街混乱的状态，让它变成一个可以安居乐业的地方。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这并不容易吧……","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[cm][show]是啊……不过，总有人需要踏出第一步，否则问题永远解决不了。过去图洛德会长没做到的事，埃迪蒂小姐想真切地做到。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]我们的首要目标，就是要去贫民街找一个对当地有所了解的人，问问他贫民街现在最大的问题是什么。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]而你们需要在这途中保护我，并协助我解决贫民街当地的麻烦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]这个任务并不容易，但我相信你们。当然请你们放心，我们会付给你们足够的契约金。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没关系，没什么能难得住我们的。不过你打算去找谁呢？不是每个人都能了解贫民街吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]非常感谢。关于询问的人选，我已经有目标了。那就是伊曼纽尔，他在当地有一定的号召力，而且我想他是整个魔爪湖最了解贫民街的人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我们明白了……那你打算什么时候出发？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]嗯，如果你们准备好了的话，那我们现在就出发吧！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}